[h1]Less Map Markers [Performance fix] 0.3.1[/h1]

[list]
[*]Building construction markers now use keyed static concept icons, restoring distinct building icons without going back to the expensive vanilla construction icon lookup.
[*]Army, navy, and conquistador construction markers keep lightweight static category icons.
[*]Raw goods/RGO and import/export map markers now use keyed static goods icons instead of the vanilla goods icon accessor.
[*]Kept the construction progress ring.
[/list]
